### =====================================================================
### RECHARGE NET — MAESTRO AUDIT v2.0
### Copertura: RBAC, State Machine, IDOR, XSS, Business Logic, Pagination,
###             Export Isolation, Dashboard Aggregation, Tariffa Fallback,
###             Avoir Paradox, Concurrent Data, Multi-Tenant Isolation
### =====================================================================

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v2

### ===================================================================
### ██████  FASE 0 — LOGIN: EMISSIONE TOKEN PER TUTTI I SOGGETTI
### ===================================================================

### 0.1 [AUTH] SuperAdmin — padrone assoluto del sistema
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"superadmin","password":"superadmin123"}
> {%
    client.global.set("t_super", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 0.2 [AUTH] Admin A — gestisce Boutique A1 e A2
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"adminA","password":"adminA123"}
> {%
    client.global.set("t_adminA", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 0.3 [AUTH] Admin B — gestisce Boutique B1 e B2
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"adminB","password":"adminB123"}
> {%
    client.global.set("t_adminB", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 0.4 [AUTH] Admin C — admin isolato senza boutique attive
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"adminC","password":"adminC123"}
> {%
    client.global.set("t_adminC", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 0.5 [AUTH] Dipendente A1 — lavora su Boutique A1 (fatture abilitate)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"dipA1","password":"dipA1123"}
> {%
    client.global.set("t_dipA1", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 0.6 [AUTH] Dipendente A2 — lavora su Boutique A2 (fatture NON abilitate)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"dipA2","password":"dipA2123"}
> {%
    client.global.set("t_dipA2", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 0.7 [AUTH] Dipendente B1 — lavora su Boutique B1
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"dipB1","password":"dipB1123"}
> {%
    client.global.set("t_dipB1", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 0.8 [AUTH] Dipendente B2 — lavora su Boutique B2
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"dipB2","password":"dipB2123"}
> {%
    client.global.set("t_dipB2", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 0.9 [SECURITY] Login con credenziali errate — ATTESO: 401
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"superadmin","password":"PASSWORD_SBAGLIATA"}

###

### 0.10 [SECURITY] Login con username inesistente — ATTESO: 401
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"fantasma","password":"12345678"}

###

### 0.11 [VALIDATION] Login con password troppo corta (< 8 char) — ATTESO: 400
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"superadmin","password":"abc"}

###

### 0.12 [SECURITY] Accesso a endpoint protetto senza token — ATTESO: 401
GET {{base}}/ricariche



### ===================================================================
### ██████  FASE 1 — GESTIONE UTENTI (RBAC SUPER_ADMIN)
### ===================================================================

### 1.1 [HAPPY PATH] SuperAdmin crea un nuovo Admin D — ATTESO: 200
POST {{base}}/utenti/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{t_super}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome":"Admin D","username":"adminD","password":"adminD123"}

###

### 1.2 [RBAC] Admin A tenta di creare un altro Admin — ATTESO: 403
POST {{base}}/utenti/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome":"Admin Fantasma","username":"fantasmaAdmin","password":"fantasma123"}

###

### 1.3 [RBAC] Dipendente tenta di creare un Admin — ATTESO: 403
POST {{base}}/utenti/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome":"Admin Chaos","username":"chaosAdmin","password":"chaos12345"}

###

### 1.4 [VALIDATION] SuperAdmin crea Admin con username troppo corto — ATTESO: 400
POST {{base}}/utenti/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{t_super}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome":"Bad","username":"ab","password":"password123"}

###

### 1.5 [VALIDATION] SuperAdmin crea Admin con password troppo corta — ATTESO: 400
POST {{base}}/utenti/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{t_super}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome":"Bad","username":"validUsername","password":"short"}

###

### 1.6 [DUPLICATE] SuperAdmin ri-crea adminA (username già esistente) — ATTESO: 409 o 400
POST {{base}}/utenti/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{t_super}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome":"Doppione","username":"adminA","password":"adminA123"}



### ===================================================================
### ██████  FASE 2 — GESTIONE BOUTIQUE (MULTI-TENANT ISOLATION)
### ===================================================================

### 2.1 [HAPPY PATH] Admin A crea Boutique A3 — ATTESO: 200
POST {{base}}/boutique
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome":"Boutique A3","citta":"Monastir"}
> {%
    client.global.set("id_boutiqueA3", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 2.2 [HAPPY PATH] Admin A consulta le sue boutique — ATTESO: 200 con lista [A1,A2,A3]
GET {{base}}/boutique
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}

###

### 2.3 [RBAC] SuperAdmin vede TUTTE le boutique del sistema — ATTESO: 200 con lista completa
GET {{base}}/boutique/tutte
Authorization: Bearer {{t_super}}

###

### 2.4 [ISOLATION] Admin B consulta le boutique di Admin A per ID — ATTESO: 403 o 404
GET {{base}}/boutique/1
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminB}}

###

### 2.5 [HAPPY PATH] Admin A abilita le fatture per Boutique A3 — ATTESO: 200
PATCH {{base}}/boutique/{{id_boutiqueA3}}/fatture?abilitato=true
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}

###

### 2.6 [ISOLATION IDOR] Admin B tenta di disabilitare le fatture di Boutique A1 — ATTESO: 403
PATCH {{base}}/boutique/1/fatture?abilitato=false
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminB}}

###

### 2.7 [RBAC] Dipendente tenta di creare una boutique — ATTESO: 403
POST {{base}}/boutique
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome":"Boutique Pirata","citta":"Pirateville"}



