POST {{base}}/tariffe
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":"ooredoo","giga":50.0,"costoAcquisto":20.000,"prezzoVendita":25.000}
> {%
    client.global.set("tariffa_ooredoo_50", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 3.3 [HAPPY PATH] Admin A crea tariffa Orange 10GB — ATTESO: 200
POST {{base}}/tariffe
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":"orange","giga":10.0,"costoAcquisto":6.000,"prezzoVendita":9.000}
> {%
    client.global.set("tariffa_orange_10", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 3.4 [HAPPY PATH] Admin A crea tariffa Telecom 20GB — ATTESO: 200
POST {{base}}/tariffe
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":"telecom","giga":20.0,"costoAcquisto":8.000,"prezzoVendita":12.000}

###

### 3.5 [HAPPY PATH] Admin A crea tariffa Fisso 10GB — ATTESO: 200
POST {{base}}/tariffe
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":"fisso","giga":10.0,"costoAcquisto":4.500,"prezzoVendita":7.000}

###

### 3.6 [HAPPY PATH] Admin A crea tariffa FALLBACK (operatore null) — ATTESO: 200
POST {{base}}/tariffe
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":null,"giga":15.0,"costoAcquisto":6.000,"prezzoVendita":9.000}
> {%
    client.global.set("tariffa_fallback_A", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 3.7 [BUSINESS LOGIC] Margine negativo: costo > vendita — ATTESO: 400
POST {{base}}/tariffe
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":"ooredoo","giga":10.0,"costoAcquisto":15.000,"prezzoVendita":10.000}

###

### 3.8 [VALIDATION] Giga negativi — ATTESO: 400
POST {{base}}/tariffe
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":"orange","giga":-5.0,"costoAcquisto":3.000,"prezzoVendita":5.000}

###

### 3.9 [VALIDATION] Prezzi a zero — ATTESO: 400 (@Positive)
POST {{base}}/tariffe
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":"orange","giga":10.0,"costoAcquisto":0,"prezzoVendita":0}

###

### 3.10 [LOGIC TRAP] Admin A tenta di trasformare la 5GB in 50GB (duplicato) — ATTESO: 400
PUT {{base}}/tariffe/{{tariffa_ooredoo_5}}
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":"ooredoo","giga":50.0,"costoAcquisto":18.000,"prezzoVendita":24.000}

###

### 3.11 [HAPPY PATH] Admin A aggiorna prezzi della 5GB mantenendo stesso operatore+giga — ATTESO: 200
PUT {{base}}/tariffe/{{tariffa_ooredoo_5}}
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":"ooredoo","giga":5.0,"costoAcquisto":3.200,"prezzoVendita":4.800}

###

### 3.12 [ISOLATION IDOR] Admin B modifica tariffa di Admin A — ATTESO: 403
PUT {{base}}/tariffe/{{tariffa_ooredoo_5}}
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":"ooredoo","giga":5.0,"costoAcquisto":1.000,"prezzoVendita":1.500}

###

### 3.13 [ISOLATION IDOR] Admin B elimina tariffa di Admin A — ATTESO: 403
DELETE {{base}}/tariffe/{{tariffa_ooredoo_5}}
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminB}}

###

### 3.14 [RBAC] SuperAdmin crea tariffa ASSEGNANDOLA ad Admin A (adminId esplicito) — ATTESO: 200
POST {{base}}/tariffe
Authorization: Bearer {{t_super}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operatore":"ooredoo","giga":200.0,"costoAcquisto":80.000,"prezzoVendita":100.000,"adminId":2}

###

### 3.15 [RBAC] Dipendente non può vedere il listino tariffe — ATTESO: 403
### (Se invece lo vede, verificare che veda SOLO le tariffe del suo admin)
GET {{base}}/tariffe
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}

###

### 3.16 [HAPPY PATH] Admin A visualizza il suo listino completo — ATTESO: 200
GET {{base}}/tariffe
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}

###

### 3.17 [RBAC] SuperAdmin visualizza listino di Admin A passando adminId — ATTESO: 200
GET {{base}}/tariffe?adminId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{t_super}}

###

### 3.18 [ISOLATION] Admin A tenta di vedere listino di Admin B con adminId — ATTESO: 403
GET {{base}}/tariffe?adminId=3
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}

###

### 3.19 [HAPPY PATH] Admin A elimina la tariffa fallback — ATTESO: 204
DELETE {{base}}/tariffe/{{tariffa_fallback_A}}
Authorization: Bearer {{t_adminA}}



