Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numero":"21111111","giga":5.0,"manuale":false}
> {%
    client.global.set("ric_auto_A1", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 4.2 [HAPPY PATH] DipA1 ricarica automatica Ooredoo 50GB — ATTESO: 201
POST {{base}}/ricariche
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numero":"21111112","giga":50.0,"manuale":false}
> {%
    client.global.set("ric_50gb_A1", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 4.3 [TARIFFA FALLBACK] DipA1 ricarica Orange 99GB (nessuna tariffa Orange 99GB → fallback) — ATTESO: 201 con tariffa fallback
POST {{base}}/ricariche
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numero":"21333333","giga":99.0,"manuale":false}

###

### 4.4 [HAPPY PATH] DipA1 ricarica manuale con prezzi espliciti — ATTESO: 201
POST {{base}}/ricariche
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numero":"21444444","giga":10.0,"manuale":true,"costoEffettivo":6.000,"costoCliente":9.000,"note":"Cliente VIP"}
> {%
    client.global.set("ric_manuale_A1", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 4.5 [THEFT ATTEMPT] DipA1 registra profitto negativo: costoEffettivo > costoCliente — ATTESO: 400
POST {{base}}/ricariche
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numero":"21555555","giga":10.0,"manuale":true,"costoEffettivo":15.000,"costoCliente":5.000}

###

### 4.6 [THEFT EQUAL] DipA1 registra margine zero (costo = prezzo): border case valido — ATTESO: 201
POST {{base}}/ricariche
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numero":"21666666","giga":10.0,"manuale":true,"costoEffettivo":8.000,"costoCliente":8.000,"note":"Pareggio volontario"}

###

### 4.7 [XSS] DipA1 inietta script nelle note — ATTESO: 400
POST {{base}}/ricariche
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numero":"21777777","giga":5.0,"manuale":true,"costoEffettivo":3.0,"costoCliente":5.0,"note":"<script>alert('xss')</script>"}

###

### 4.8 [XSS VARIANT] DipA1 usa tag HTML generici nelle note — ATTESO: 400
POST {{base}}/ricariche
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numero":"21888888","giga":5.0,"manuale":true,"costoEffettivo":3.0,"costoCliente":5.0,"note":"<b>testo</b>"}

###

### 4.9 [VALIDATION] Numero telefonico vuoto — ATTESO: 400
POST {{base}}/ricariche
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numero":"","giga":5.0,"manuale":false}

###

### 4.10 [VALIDATION] Giga negativi — ATTESO: 400
POST {{base}}/ricariche
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numero":"21999999","giga":-10.0,"manuale":false}

###

### 4.11 [ISOLATION IDOR] DipA2 elimina ricarica di DipA1 — ATTESO: 403
DELETE {{base}}/ricariche/{{ric_auto_A1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA2}}

###

### 4.12 [ISOLATION IDOR] DipB1 elimina ricarica di DipA1 — ATTESO: 403
DELETE {{base}}/ricariche/{{ric_auto_A1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipB1}}

###

### 4.13 [HAPPY PATH] DipA1 elimina la propria ricarica automatica — ATTESO: 204
DELETE {{base}}/ricariche/{{ric_auto_A1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}

###

### 4.14 [NOT FOUND] DipA1 elimina ricarica già eliminata — ATTESO: 404
DELETE {{base}}/ricariche/{{ric_auto_A1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{t_dipA1}}

###

### 4.15 [ISOLATION IDOR] DipA2 modifica ricarica di DipA1 — ATTESO: 403
